{"parse": {"title": "衣着/人生填色格", "pageid": 141640, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-304504.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-id=\"304504\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-304504.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-304504.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-304504_bd_p.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-304504_bd_p.webp\" style=\"display:none;\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">十间摄影棚对她翘首以待，她作为职员的忙碌已不是扮演。</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-304504 bd.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/09/Spine_static-304504_bd.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"202\" height=\"512\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"202\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3045\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%9D%E8%92%82\" title=\"贝蒂\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%9D%E8%92%82\" title=\"贝蒂\"><img alt=\"贝蒂\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%9D%E8%92%82\" title=\"贝蒂\">贝蒂</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>以明日建造</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304504</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">贝蒂已经充分习惯了彩色。<br />方正的有声匣子将会放映绚丽的画面。摄影棚是更浓缩、更便于装配的方格。第一间收发室是米色，第二间茶水间是绿色，格子里的家具是三原色。她穿梭于简洁、摩登的格子之中——瞧，每个时代有每个时代的“摩登”。<br />这是一个轻快、忙碌的时代。十个都市故事同时投入生产，二十三位编剧一起开动脑筋。大都会的女郎们在一间间方格办公室里喝咖啡、打字、接电话，她们妙语连珠。新的摄像机连她——女主角替身的裙角方格的色彩都能忠实记录。这些格子将出现在电视黄金档，然后在下个月掀起一阵时装热潮。<br />在一间间彩色格子中，现代人将女孩儿们的故事装配为新的童话与神话。她们展示着自己的职业风采，贝蒂觉得不算坏。<br />在导演的呼唤下，她奔向下一个格子。雨伞、蒙德里安帽、茶色格裙——三分钟后，她已变成又一位全新的都市女郎。很少有人知道，她的背影将在十二个电视台播放。在格子与格子之间，她必不可少。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304504\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c1/Belonging-304504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“准时”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\"> \"Punctuality\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />17<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>精巧、简约的腕表，都市白领的标配，受访者一眼看中了它。<br />她日程表里的戏一场接着一场，而准时是种至关重要的品质。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2d/Belonging-304505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“蒙德里安风格”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\"> \"Mondrian Style\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>与受访者帽子的配色相得益彰的长柄伞，兼具实用与美观。从Yves Saint Laurent展示了那些蒙德里安裙开始，这场时尚风暴就迅速成为一种万能的视觉公式。现在，《红、黄、蓝的构成》流向了这把晴雨两用伞。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/32/Belonging-304506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">两份保障<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Doubled Windsors</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />7<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>活泼的黄色，沉稳的蓝色，演员要随时准备好为角色服务。<br />受访者在展示迅速替换领带的技巧时不小心将它们打了结，但小小的失误并不影响我们对她的整体评价——<br />一位专业、优秀的替身演员。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 人生填色格1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 人生填色格2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%A1%AB%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%BC2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">人生填色格 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Life in Frames</small></span></span>"}}